{"title":"Career roadmap · Catalogue Specialist","role":"Catalogue Specialist","summary":"Career alignment:\nB.Com – E-Commerce is a practical foundation for a Catalogue Specialist, a role focused on maintaining accurate and complete product information across e-commerce platforms. The work combines product data management, e-commerce operations, content quality, taxonomy, SEO, cataloguing tools, Excel and marketplace processes.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role is broader than simply uploading product descriptions. A strong Catalogue Specialist understands the complete flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product data","Classification","Content","Images","Attributes","Pricing","Search","Quality checks","Publication","Performance"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Catalogue Intern, Catalogue Executive, E-Commerce Operations Executive"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Catalogue Specialist, Product Data Specialist, Marketplace Executive"}],[{"text":"3–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Catalogue Specialist, Catalogue Analyst, E-Commerce Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Catalogue Manager, E-Commerce Operations Manager, Product Information Manager"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Head of Catalogue, E-Commerce Operations Head, Product Information Management Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — E-Commerce & Business Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"E-commerce fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B2C"},{"text":"B2B"},{"text":"D2C"},{"text":"Marketplaces"},{"text":"Online stores"},{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Shopping cart"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"Fulfilment"},{"text":"Logistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product catalogue fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product"},{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Product variant"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Brand"},{"text":"Attribute"},{"text":"Product specification"},{"text":"Product description"},{"text":"Product image"},{"text":"Product identifier"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a catalogue for 100 products with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Product name"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Brand"},{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Product attributes"},{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Stock status"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Catalogue Management"},{"type":"p","text":"This should become the core skill-development year."},{"type":"h","text":"Product Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to structure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product titles"},{"text":"Short descriptions"},{"text":"Long descriptions"},{"text":"Specifications"},{"text":"Features"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Size"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Compatibility"},{"text":"Warranty"},{"text":"Country of origin"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product attributes"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Laptop"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brand","Model","Processor","RAM","Storage","Display","GPU","OS","Warranty"]},{"type":"p","text":"The Catalogue Specialist must understand category-specific attributes rather than using the same data structure for every product."},{"type":"h","text":"Product Taxonomy"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Department","Category","Subcategory","Product Type","SKU"]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Electronics","Computers","Laptops","Gaming Laptops","SKU"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category hierarchy"},{"text":"Product classification"},{"text":"Attribute mapping"},{"text":"Product types"},{"text":"Variant relationships"},{"text":"Parent-child products"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Good taxonomy improves:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Filtering"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel for Catalogue Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel is one of the most important tools for this career."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"IFERROR"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"Text functions"},{"text":"LEFT/RIGHT/MID"},{"text":"CONCAT/TEXTJOIN"},{"text":"TRIM"},{"text":"CLEAN"},{"text":"SUBSTITUTE"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Master Sheet"},{"type":"p","text":"with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Brand"},{"text":"Attributes"},{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"SEO fields"},{"text":"Status"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create automated checks for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing attributes"},{"text":"Duplicate SKUs"},{"text":"Invalid categories"},{"text":"Missing images"},{"text":"Incorrect prices"},{"text":"Duplicate product titles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — E-Commerce Platforms + SEO"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how catalogues are managed on different systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Platforms"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shopify"},{"text":"WooCommerce"},{"text":"Magento/Adobe Commerce"},{"text":"Marketplace seller systems"},{"text":"PIM systems"},{"text":"ERP systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual interfaces differ by company, but the underlying concepts are similar."},{"type":"h","text":"Product Information Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product master data"},{"text":"Data enrichment"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Attribute governance"},{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Approval workflows"},{"text":"Product lifecycle"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier data","Catalogue team","Quality check","Approval","Publication"]},{"type":"h","text":"SEO for Product Pages"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Product-title optimisation"},{"text":"Product descriptions"},{"text":"Meta titles"},{"text":"Meta descriptions"},{"text":"Structured product information"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Search-friendly URLs"},{"text":"Image alt text"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important distinction:"},{"type":"p","text":"SEO writing ≠ keyword stuffing."},{"type":"p","text":"Product content should remain accurate, useful and readable."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Marketplace Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand marketplace-specific catalogue processes."},{"type":"h","text":"Product listing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product creation"},{"text":"SKU mapping"},{"text":"Variant creation"},{"text":"Attribute mapping"},{"text":"Image requirements"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Listing status"},{"text":"Product compliance"},{"text":"Content quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue errors"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to troubleshoot:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duplicate listings"},{"text":"Missing attributes"},{"text":"Invalid category"},{"text":"Image rejection"},{"text":"Title violations"},{"text":"Incorrect specifications"},{"text":"Variant errors"},{"text":"SKU mismatches"},{"text":"Pricing mismatches"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern Catalogue Specialist should understand catalogue performance."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Total SKUs"},{"text":"Active listings"},{"text":"Inactive listings"},{"text":"Missing-data percentage"},{"text":"Catalogue completeness"},{"text":"Category distribution"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Content errors"},{"text":"Product conversion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Window functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use SQL to analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Products"},{"text":"SKUs"},{"text":"Categories"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Product performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python — Optional but Valuable"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Excel automation"},{"text":"CSV processing"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Missing-value detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier Excel","Python validation","Error report","Clean catalogue","Upload"]},{"type":"p","text":"This can significantly improve productivity in large catalogues."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a:"},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce Product Catalogue Management System"},{"type":"h","text":"Product module"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Product name"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Brand"},{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Attributes"},{"text":"Images"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue-quality module"},{"type":"p","text":"Automatically detect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing product information"},{"text":"Duplicate SKUs"},{"text":"Invalid categories"},{"text":"Missing images"},{"text":"Duplicate products"},{"text":"Incorrect attribute values"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Catalogue completeness"},{"text":"Category coverage"},{"text":"Active/inactive products"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Content quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced version"},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL database"},{"text":"Python validation"},{"text":"Product-search functionality"},{"text":"Role-based access"},{"text":"PIM-style approval workflow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If an honours/extended pathway is available, use the additional depth for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Data","Taxonomy","Attributes","Content","QA"]},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Catalogue","Orders","Conversion","Customer Behaviour","Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Information Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["PIM","ERP","Marketplace","Website","Data Governance"]},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","APIs","Python","Automation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Catalogue Operations"},{"text":"Product data, SKU management, QA"}],[{"text":"Product Information Management"},{"text":"PIM, taxonomy, data governance"}],[{"text":"Marketplace Operations"},{"text":"Listings, seller systems, marketplace rules"}],[{"text":"E-Commerce SEO"},{"text":"Product SEO, search optimisation"}],[{"text":"Product Content"},{"text":"Copywriting, images, content quality"}],[{"text":"E-Commerce Analytics"},{"text":"SQL, Power BI, statistics"}],[{"text":"Catalogue Automation"},{"text":"Python, APIs, data pipelines"}],[{"text":"Product Operations"},{"text":"Catalogue + inventory + business operations"}]]},{"type":"flow","items":["For the target role, Catalogue Operations","Excel","Product Information Management","E-Commerce Analytics is a strong combination."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 1 — Commerce"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business","Marketing","Statistics","Communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 2 — E-Commerce"},{"type":"flow","items":["Products","SKUs","Orders","Marketplaces"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 3 — Catalogue"},{"type":"flow","items":["Taxonomy","Attributes","Product Content","Data Quality"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 4 — Tools"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Power Query","PIM/ERP"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 5 — Digital"},{"type":"flow","items":["SEO","Search","Marketplace Operations"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 6 — Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL + Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Level 7 — Automation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","APIs","AI-assisted Catalogue Management"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from Year 2."},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-Commerce Intern"},{"text":"Catalogue Management Intern"},{"text":"Product Operations Intern"},{"text":"Marketplace Operations Intern"},{"text":"E-Commerce Operations Intern"},{"text":"Product Data Intern"},{"text":"Digital Commerce Intern"},{"text":"E-Commerce Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to learn"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain practical experience with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU creation"},{"text":"Product uploads"},{"text":"Product categorisation"},{"text":"Attribute mapping"},{"text":"Product descriptions"},{"text":"Image management"},{"text":"Marketplace listings"},{"text":"Catalogue quality checks"},{"text":"Inventory data"},{"text":"Excel reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A real catalogue internship is particularly valuable because catalogue work involves high-volume operational data."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are useful but secondary to practical catalogue experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shopify fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketplace operations"},{"text":"E-commerce management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Product content"},{"text":"Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"PIM fundamentals"}]}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Com – E-Commerce, possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Catalogue Specialist"},{"text":"Catalogue Executive"},{"text":"Product Data Specialist"},{"text":"Product Content Specialist"},{"text":"E-Commerce Executive"},{"text":"E-Commerce Operations Executive"},{"text":"Marketplace Executive"},{"text":"Product Operations Associate"},{"text":"Product Information Specialist"},{"text":"Listing Specialist"},{"text":"Catalogue Analyst"},{"text":"Marketplace Operations Analyst"},{"text":"E-Commerce Analyst"}]},{"type":"p","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Catalogue Specialist"},{"text":"Catalogue Manager"},{"text":"Product Information Manager"},{"text":"E-Commerce Operations Manager"},{"text":"Marketplace Manager"},{"text":"Product Operations Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Be comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Product variants"},{"text":"Attributes"},{"text":"Taxonomy"},{"text":"Product hierarchy"},{"text":"Product master"},{"text":"PIM"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect practical tests involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Text functions"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"You receive 20,000 product records from multiple suppliers. Many have different naming conventions and missing attributes. How would you prepare them for upload?"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong approach:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Standardise","Clean","Deduplicate","Map categories","Validate attributes","Complete missing data","Quality check","Upload"]},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product views"},{"text":"Search impressions"},{"text":"Click-through rate"},{"text":"Add-to-cart rate"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Average order value"},{"text":"Return rate"},{"text":"Catalogue completeness"},{"text":"Product availability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Catalogue Specialist should understand that better product data can affect search visibility, customer understanding and conversion, while recognising that many other factors also influence sales."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not required for becoming a Catalogue Specialist."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful options for progression include:"},{"type":"table","header":["PG","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"Commerce depth"}],[{"text":"MBA E-Commerce"},{"text":"E-commerce management"}],[{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"Digital commerce + marketing"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"E-commerce analytics"}],[{"text":"MSc Data Analytics"},{"text":"Data-heavy catalogue roles"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Digital commerce"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For catalogue operations, experience + platform knowledge + analytics skills can be more important than a postgraduate degree during the early career stage."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's pathways:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc E-Commerce"},{"text":"MSc Digital Marketing"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Information Systems"},{"text":"MSc Digital Business"},{"text":"MSc Supply Chain Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international study, verify current university admission, tuition and work-visa conditions before applying."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com E-Commerce"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Catalogue Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Information Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Catalogue / Product Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics route"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Specialist"},{"type":"flow","items":["Catalogue Analyst","E-Commerce Analyst","Product Analyst","Senior Product/E-Commerce Analyst"]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations route"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue Specialist"},{"type":"flow","items":["E-Commerce Operations Executive","Marketplace Manager","E-Commerce Operations Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Automation Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Catalogue management is highly suitable for automation."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted product descriptions"},{"text":"Automated attribute extraction"},{"text":"Product classification"},{"text":"Image tagging"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Data-quality automation"},{"text":"Product-title generation"},{"text":"Search optimisation"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future workflow could become:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier Data","AI Extraction","Taxonomy Mapping","Validation","Human Review","Automated Publication"]},{"type":"p","text":"The human specialist remains important for accuracy, policy compliance, product interpretation and exception handling."},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional catalogue work:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Manual Product Entry","Excel","Upload"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future catalogue operations:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier Data","PIM","AI Classification","Automated Enrichment","Quality Validation","Omnichannel Publication"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important future skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Information Management"},{"text":"AI-assisted content generation"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"E-commerce analytics"},{"text":"Product search"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"AI quality control"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is likely to evolve from data-entry-heavy catalogue work toward product information governance and e-commerce data operations."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce"},{"type":"h","text":"E-commerce operations + Marketplace fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalogue"},{"type":"flow","items":["SKU Management","Taxonomy","Attribute Mapping","Product Content"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"flow","items":["Advanced Excel","Power Query","PIM/ERP"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product SEO","Search","Marketplace optimisation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL + Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","APIs","AI-assisted catalogue management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Attention to detail","Communication","Data quality","Problem solving"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commerce","E-Commerce","Product & SKU Fundamentals"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["Catalogue Management","Taxonomy","Attributes","Advanced Excel"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketplace Operations","Product SEO","PIM","Power BI/SQL","Internship"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4"},{"type":"flow","items":["Catalogue Analytics","Automation","Python","Final Project","Placement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Graduation target"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com E-Commerce","catalogue management","advanced Excel","product taxonomy","marketplace operations","SEO fundamentals","Power BI/SQL","internship","practical catalogue project."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Com – E-Commerce → Catalogue Specialist, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","E-Commerce","Product Information Management","Excel","Catalogue QA","Marketplace Operations","SEO","Power BI/SQL","Internship."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term goal should be to move beyond basic product listing/data entry toward Product Information Management, Catalogue Analytics, E-Commerce Operations or Product Operations, where the combination of commerce knowledge, data quality and technology creates much stronger career progression."}]}]}